# Partenaire v2.0 — STAGING build env for the MP web/admin frontend.
# Loaded only when building with `--mode staging` (see the staging Vercel
# project's Build Command), so it never affects the prod build (.env.production).
# Points the React app at the STAGING MP backend so v2 testing never hits prod.
#
# ORANGE (Option A, 2026-11-04): PROXY FIRST. Orange Cameroun resets every
# Render-hosted name; the Vercel proxy (vercel.json, host staging.stenamo.com)
# is the only path proven on Orange (PROXYFIRST APK: login + sale + void).
#   • Web on staging.stenamo.com: this address IS its own site → same-origin,
#     no CORS preflight (identical to "/api"). Its fallback is "/api".
#   • APK: this address first; Render direct only if it fails to connect.
VITE_API_URL=https://staging.stenamo.com/api
# Fallback (APK only — the web's one fallback is "/api" on its own site).
VITE_API_FALLBACKS=https://partenaire-account-server-staging.onrender.com/api
